		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Run at VDD = 5.0V from the on-board boost converter, which is the datasheet's typical operating point (recommended range 3.5-5.5V). This retires the old question of whether V_IH scales with VDD: the datasheet's 3.4V minimum is specified at VDD = 5.0V and is now used exactly as written, with the level-shifting buffer raising the 3.3V NEOPIX line to meet it. Static draw is 0.5mA each, 8mA for the ring, so the ring must be gated by RING_EN rather than left powered."
