		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Vdrive on 1-3, RING_EN on 4, GND on 5, 6, 8, 9, NEOPIX on 7, NEOPIX_RET on 10. Mates with the main board's 10-way ring FFC connector. Pin 4 was a fourth Vdrive way before the ring moved to a 5V boost; it now carries the enable for the boost converter, which is what lets the MCU disconnect the LEDs' 8mA static draw. Three ways still carry Vdrive, about 370mA at full white, which is well inside a 0.5mm FFC's rating."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "a1fd1e7c-c732-4239-aeee-8de0aeacd93c")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
